WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:09.560
c. AD 1 · Llandough hill, above the River
Ely

2
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.868
The pit is already dug. We lay them here.

3
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.633
Gently, now. Cross the arms. Let them look
up the slope.

4
00:00:40.292 --> 00:00:43.910
So young. The wind is cold up here.

5
00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:48.395
Stay with me a while. Then we fill it in,
together.

